  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n) (\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n);\n\n\tlocalparam\tNUM_BYTES = DW/8;\n\treg\t[AW-1:0]\tADDR_REG;\n\treg\t[DW/8-1:0]\tWSTRB_REG;\n\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tDATA_REG;\n\treg\tSTATE; // 0: IDLE, 1: READ, 2: WRITE\n\n\t// State Machine Logic\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tADDR_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tDATA_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tWSTRB_REG <= 0;\n\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\tSTATE <= 0;\n\t\tend\n\t\telse begin\n\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE) begin\n\t\t\t\tif (STATE == 0) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Setup Phase\n\t\t\t\t\tADDR_REG <= PADDR;\n\t\t\t\t\tWSTRB_REG <= PWSTRB;\n\t\t\t\t\tDATA_REG <= PWDATA;\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PWRITE)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 2;\n\t\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 1;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse if (STATE == 1) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Read Response\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= DATA_REG;\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\telse if (STATE == 2) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t// Write Response\n\t\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 0;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\telse begin\n\t\t\t\t// Idle or No Select\n\t\t\t\tPREADY <= 1'b1;\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= 0;\n\t\t\t\tPSLVERR <= 1'b0;\n\t\t\t\tSTATE <= 0;\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Optional: Logic to handle PSLVERR based on PPROT if specific protection checks are needed.\n\t// Per requirements: \"PSLVERR may stay low for in-range accesses.\"\n\t// Assuming default behavior allows all accesses unless specific logic is added.\n\t// For a generic implementation without specific register map, we keep PSLVERR low.\n\t// If PPROT indicates a protected region not implemented, PSLVERR could be asserted here.\n\t// Currently, no specific address decoding is implemented, so all accesses succeed.\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
